# Universal File Format Converter v1.7.0

Adds batch task management, reusable conversion presets, and more informative results.

- See per-file results, cancel a task, and retry failed items. Results distinguish complete conversions, partial outputs, previews, and failures.

- Save JPEG quality, maximum image dimensions, or a page selection and use the preset from the main window or floating converter.

- Automatic cleanup tracks generated files and skips files that have changed.

